.. Shared substitutions for the Element manual.
.. To use these on a page, add ``.. include:: /shortcuts.rstext`` near the top,
.. then reference a substitution inline, e.g. ``|El|`` or ``File |rarr| Preferences``.

.. Product name. Lets us restyle or rename in one place.
